{"id": "34494", "title": "凤凰变麻雀", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 46, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34494.htm", "intro": "这女人到底懂不懂得照顾自己？！要不是那两头笨骡子，贪食人家营生的花，他还不知自己与个如花似玉的俏寡妇为邻，瞧瞧她带着个这世人口中的小拖油瓶，裹着小脚，锄子连扛都扛不动，还想犁土种花咧！挖挖蚯蚓还差不多；来路不明的身份引得人议论纷纷，都说她断掌、克夫、命带煞！他一定是昏了头了，才会鸡婆过了头，为她当花夫、车夫不打紧，让她女儿巴着大腿叫爹爹，他乐得多个娃，看她伤风欠人疼，就想把她娶回家惜命命，只是，他想负责，人家却不是他负责得起的……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34494", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2188591.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2188592.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2188593.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2188594.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2188595.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2188596.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2188597.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2188598.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2188599.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2188600.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2188601.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2188602.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2188603.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2188604.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2188605.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2188606.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2188607.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2188608.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2188609.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2188610.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2188611.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2188612.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2188613.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2188614.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file": "2188615.html"